            "body": "Self-evaluation per AGENTS.md / the Agent Guidelines note above:\n\n- **Not a duplicate**: searched open PRs for `starting_after` — only this PR addresses it (the one other hit is a closed 2025 feature PR mentioning the field in passing).\n- **Value**: negative `starting_after` currently returns HTTP 500 (`IndexError: deque index out of range`) or silently replays from the deque tail and never delivers `response.completed` (permanent stream hang). Both failure modes reproduced at logic level against the exact generator code; the fix is the 2-line schema bound + clamp in this PR.\n- **Testing**: `ruff check` / `ruff format --check` clean. No unit test yet — happy to add one under tests/entrypoints/openai if reviewers prefer it in this PR rather than a follow-up.\n- **AI assistance**: disclosed in the PR description; every line reviewed by the human submitter.",
